  <li><a href=3D"#EDMEntityNaming,Definition&amp;Keys-Keys">Keys</a></li>
  <li><a href=3D"#EDMEntityNaming,Definition&amp;Keys-DimensionTables">Dime=
nsion Tables</a>
   <ul class=3D"toc-indentation">
    <ul class=3D"toc-indentation">
     <li><a href=3D"#EDMEntityNaming,Definition&amp;Keys-Figure1-SCDTypesas=
