ords</a></li>
    <li><a href=3D"#EDMEntityNaming,Definition&amp;Keys-Abbreviations">Abbr=
eviations</a></li>
    <li><a href=3D"#EDMEntityNaming,Definition&amp;Keys-Domains">Domains</a=
></li>
    <li><a href=3D"#EDMEntityNaming,Definition&amp;Keys-Prefixes">Prefixes<=
/a></li>
    <li><a href=3D"#EDMEntityNaming,Definition&amp;Keys-Examplesfollowingth=
enamingconventions">Examples following the naming conventions</a></li>
   </ul></li>
  <li><a href=3D"#EDMEntityNaming,Definition&amp;Keys-InsertViews">Insert V=
iews</a></li>
